                <pb facs="0698" n="686" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv06/pg686"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of the Note to the German Delegation</hi></head>
                <p>The preparation of the printed copy of the Treaty of Peace and of the documents
                    intended to be signed by the plenipotentiaries has <pb facs="0699" n="687"
                        xml:id="pg687"/> brought to light various mistakes and errors in the
                    printing: lists of these are attached thereto and the corrections have been made
                    accordingly.</p>
            </div>
